precision, timing, and nerves of steel.\n\nWhy play Overstep?\n\n11 Challenging Levels: Progress through stages that evolve from \"tricky\" to \"nearly impossible.\"\n\nPrecision Gameplay: Experience a pure parkour mechanic where every jump and landing counts.\n\nSmart Checkpoints: Don't lose all your progress! Our checkpoint system ensures you can jump back into the action after a fall.\n\nHardcore Difficulty: Designed for players who miss the era of games that provided a real challenge. No hand-holding here.\n\nImmersive VR Design: Clean visuals and intuitive controls that keep you focused on the next jump.\n\nDo you have what it takes to reach the final platform? Download Overstep today and prove your agility!", "short_description": "Conquer 11 grueling parkour courses. Test your limits and master Overstep!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1YdVnri0NjJoDB8afsISdHrRQgaTDsj6QjNi46jbfLYw/edit?usp=sharing", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Taqo Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://secret-adjustment-848.notion.site/Taqo-Games-Official-Website-2ae914827180802ea420de23e9eb2d80?source=copy_link", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["GAMEPAD", "OCULUS_TOUCH", "TRACKED_KEYBOARD"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "25552997591000343"}}]}, "schedule